# L §2.3 atom: STR is "a text literal, §7.1"; L §7.1 "A text literal ... stands in a row, a pin or an ask line" (writer 8,
# OQ-6). form's row is "PIT-37": the ask's comparison holds (q1); pinned to "PIT-36" it doesn't (q2, the pin listed,
# L §8.2 pinned:).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input form: text

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  form = "PIT-37"

ask q1: form == "PIT-37"
ask q2: form == "PIT-37" with form = "PIT-36"
=== expect
q1: true
  cut 2026-12-31
q2: false
  pinned: form = "PIT-36"
  cut 2026-12-31
